---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Shipping Policy" description="Kidtoy Factory shipping policy - international delivery options, lead times, and logistics for B2B wholesale orders.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-navy mb-6">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-500 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Shipping Methods</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Air Freight:</strong> 7-10 business days. Recommended for orders 50-500 pcs.</li>
        <li><strong>Sea Freight:</strong> 20-30 business days. Best for bulk orders 500+ pcs.</li>
        <li><strong>Express Courier (DHL/UPS/FedEx):</strong> 3-7 business days. Ideal for samples and small orders.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">Processing Time</h2>
      <p>Standard orders ship within 15-25 business days. Custom OEM orders require 25-40 business days. Samples ship within 2-3 business days.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">Shipping Costs</h2>
      <p>Shipping costs are calculated based on order volume, destination, and shipping method. Contact our team for a precise freight quote.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">Tracking</h2>
      <p>Tracking information is provided for all shipments once dispatched.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
